{"id":72966,"date":"2026-11-07T06:34:04","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:34:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72966"},"modified":"2026-11-07T07:39:34","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:39:34","slug":"rota-do-castro-do-banho-e-trilho-do-vouga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/rota-do-castro-do-banho-e-trilho-do-vouga\/","title":{"rendered":"Rota do Castro do Banho e Trilho do Vouga 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Rota do Castro do Banho e Trilho do Vouga 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Rota do Castro do Banho e Trilho do Vouga 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), na freguesia de <strong>Serrazes<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Integrada no programa municipal \u00abPercursos Pedestres 2026 \u2014 Hiking Trails\u00bb, a atividade \u00e9 promovida pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul e pela Termalistur, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a Junta de Freguesia de Serrazes e a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Festas Anuais de Serrazes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso pedestre combina os tra\u00e7ados homologados <strong>PR11 e PR12<\/strong> numa extens\u00e3o de <strong>13 km<\/strong> (dura\u00e7\u00e3o estimada de 3h30), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o agendada para as <strong>08h30<\/strong> junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia de Serrazes. O itiner\u00e1rio explora o patrim\u00f3nio arqueol\u00f3gico do Castro do Banho e as paisagens ribeirinhas do rio Vouga, contando com o acompanhamento de T\u00e9cnicos de Desporto do munic\u00edpio.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um valor de <strong>4,00 \u20ac<\/strong> por participante (revertendo para a freguesia\/associa\u00e7\u00e3o local para o refor\u00e7o alimentar) e inclui seguro de acidentes pessoais, refor\u00e7o e carimbo no \u00abPassaporte do Caminhante\u00bb, existindo ainda a op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio facultativo (15,00 \u20ac).<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16